{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばんです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メンバーが二次元に染まってきておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誠に嬉しい事ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n二次元は本当に素晴らしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/24/1626381/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/24/1626381/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁみんな。\nおいでよ二次元の世界へ!!\nあとね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n二次元だけじゃなくて三次元にも素敵な方々はたくさんいるよね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/24/1626381/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、ＫＥＲＡのモデルのＡＫＩＲＡ 様のSTORYBOOKを買ったよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n女性なのにかっこよくて、でも凄く美しくてかわいいお方!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て勉強し、癒されています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うお〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n１７歳は自分磨きもしていこうかなと思ったりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はオフだったからゆっくりしたな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお仕事あったけど、明日からまた月曜日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新たに気を引きしめて頑張るぞ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも一緒にがんばろうねっ!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/02/24/1626381/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}